 beiden als Liebespaar Harry und Wayne, das den Schönheitswettbewerb organisieren soll. Aber während sie versuchen, Happys jungen Schönheitsköniginnen das Gewinnen beizubringen, stoßen die beiden rasch auf unerhört unvorhersehbare Konsequenzen!","duration":6959000,"originalContentDuration":5879000,"allotment":6959,"rating":"6","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a7db5fabe4922519c756c54/screenshot16_9_1786623483380.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Comedy","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/6a7db5fabe4922519c756c54/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a7db5fabe4922519c756c54/poster_1786623483380.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=694"},{"aspectRatio":"4:3","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a7db5fabe4922519c756c54/screenshot4_3_1786623483380.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=480&q=75&w=640"},{"aspectRatio":"16:9","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a7db5fabe4922519c756c54/screenshot16_9_1786623483380.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"}],"categories":[{"id":"5cd15239d9e0ec55c4ecc014"},{"id":"68a484f249074cd91191347e"},{"id":"60ec1639535a680007bcc6a6"},{"id":"5f0dead91d386100072ae1ab"},{"id":"69de4a74029c431826dffe0c"}],"poster16_9":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6a7db5fabe4922519c756c54/poster16_9_1786623483380.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"clip":{"actors":["Steve Zahn","Jeremy Northam","William H. Macy","Ally Walker","Illeana Douglas","M.C. Gainey","Mo Gaffney","Ron Perlman","Paul Dooley","Jillian Berard"],"directors":["Mark Illsley"],"producers":["Rick Montgomery","Ed Stone"],"originalReleaseDate":"1999-01-31T00:00:00Z"},"avail":{},"stream_url":"https://cfd-v4-service-channel-stitcher-use1-1.prd.pluto.tv/v2/stitch/hls/episode/6a7db5fabe4922519c756c54/master.m3u8?advertisingId=&appName=web&appVersion=7.9.0-a9cca6b89aea4dc0998b92a51989d2adb9a9025d&app_name=web&clientDev